{"id":"e5cb4b74acf0f7a9","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-arithmetical-completeness.md","title":"Arithmetical Completeness","display":"thm-arithmetical-completeness — Arithmetical Completeness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-arithmetical-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-arithmetical-completeness"],"display":"thm-arithmetical-completeness — Arithmetical Completeness","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-arithmetical-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-arithmetical-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arithmetical-completeness — Arithmetical Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"55612987d4585fa4\" href=\"?note=55612987d4585fa4\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation\">89-df-arithmetical-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"86ad48bbd1843ed6\" href=\"?note=86ad48bbd1843ed6\" title=\"89-df-peano-arithmetic\">89-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f382173effd5662\" href=\"?note=8f382173effd5662\" title=\"89-df-pa-provable-formula\">89-df-pa-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"be68cce492414c6b\" href=\"?note=be68cce492414c6b\" title=\"89-thm-solovay-theorem\">89-thm-solovay-theorem</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is the set of PA arithmetical realizations.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> is the PA-provable-sentence set, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> is standard-model soundness of PA.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 9 章，印刷页 124–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n此处按原书使用 PA 的标准模型可靠性。原文在证明新增根节点的极限句为真、反解释不可证时使用“PA 所证都真”；仅排除爆炸的一致性不能替代这一步的来源依据。该条件并未被宣称为所有理论推广或其他证明的最弱条件。完整方向来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b7050f6732cc53d7\" href=\"?note=b7050f6732cc53d7\" title=\"89-lem-solovay-lem2\">89-lem-solovay-lem2</a> 与 GL 的算术可靠性；本文件保留原有定理接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"86ad48bbd1843ed6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-pa-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8f382173effd5662","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-pa-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-solovay-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-solovay-lem2","status":"resolved","id":"b7050f6732cc53d7","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 9 章，印刷页 124–130；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n此处按原书使用 PA 的标准模型可靠性。原文在证明新增根节点的极限句为真、反解释不可证时使用“PA 所证都真”；仅排除爆炸的一致性不能替代这一步的来源依据。该条件并未被宣称为所有理论推广或其他证明的最弱条件。完整方向来自 [[89-lem-solovay-lem2]] 与 GL 的算术可靠性；本文件保留原有定理接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArSound}(\\mathrm{PA})\\land A\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\;\n\\tau(A)\\notin\\mathrm{PForm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}.","display":true}],"bytes":1679,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-499","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-thm-arithmetical-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["55612987d4585fa4","1f581262c09d5e34","86ad48bbd1843ed6","0ce064881a79d6f7","8f382173effd5662","0006800fa1c85177","be68cce492414c6b","b7050f6732cc53d7"]}